---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — PHV Prep UK"
  description="How the PHV Prep UK app collects, uses, and protects your personal data."
>
  <main class="md:flex md:justify-center">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-[750px]">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: 4 June 2026</em></p>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how the <strong>PHV Prep UK</strong> mobile
        application ("the app") collects, uses, and protects your personal data.
        The app is operated by <strong>John Akhis Moreno</strong>, an individual
        based in the United Kingdom, who is the data controller responsible for
        your information. You can contact us at any time at
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        PHV Prep UK is an independent study aid and is not affiliated with,
        authorised by, or endorsed by City of Wolverhampton Council or any
        licensing authority.
      </p>

      <h2>What data we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Account information.</strong> When you create an account we
          collect your email address through Firebase Authentication so we can
          identify your account and keep your progress synced.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Learning data.</strong> We store your exam attempts, scores,
          answers, the questions you mark as incorrect, and your premium status
          in Cloud Firestore so the app can track your progress and tailor your
          practice.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>AI Tutor messages.</strong> When you use the in-app AI Tutor,
          the messages you type are sent to Anthropic to generate a response.
          Please avoid including sensitive personal information in these messages.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage and device data.</strong> We use Firebase Analytics to
          collect information about how the app is used, such as the features you
          open, your device type, operating system version, and diagnostic or
          crash data. This helps us find and fix problems.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Purchase data.</strong> If you buy PHV Prep Premium, the
          payment is processed by Apple or Google. We never see or store your
          card details. We store only a transaction identifier and your premium
          status so we can unlock and verify your purchase.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide, maintain, and secure the app and your account.</li>
        <li>To track your progress and personalise your practice.</li>
        <li>To unlock and verify premium access.</li>
        <li>To generate AI Tutor responses to your questions.</li>
        <li>To understand usage and improve the app.</li>
        <li>To respond to your support requests.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Legal bases (UK GDPR)</h2>
      <p>We rely on the following legal bases to process your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Performance of a contract</strong> — to deliver the service you
          sign up for, including syncing progress and unlocking premium.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Legitimate interests</strong> — to keep the app secure,
          understand usage, and improve our service.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent</strong> — where required, for example for certain
          analytics. You can withdraw consent at any time.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we share data with</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with the service
        providers that help us run the app:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Firebase</strong> (Authentication, Cloud Firestore,
          Analytics, Cloud Functions, and Hosting) — provides our backend,
          database, and analytics infrastructure.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Anthropic</strong> — processes the messages you send to the AI
          Tutor in order to generate replies.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Apple App Store and Google Play</strong> — process payments for
          premium purchases.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Where your data is stored</h2>
      <p>
        Your account and learning data are stored in Firebase's
        <strong>europe-west2 (London)</strong> region. AI Tutor messages are
        processed by Anthropic, which may involve transferring your message
        outside the United Kingdom (for example, to the United States). Where data
        leaves the UK, it is protected by appropriate safeguards such as Standard
        Contractual Clauses or the UK International Data Transfer Addendum.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your account and learning data for as long as your account is
        active. If you ask us to delete your account, or after a prolonged period
        of inactivity, we delete or anonymise your personal data, except where we
        are required to retain certain records by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK data protection law you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>access the personal data we hold about you;</li>
        <li>have inaccurate data corrected;</li>
        <li>have your data erased;</li>
        <li>restrict or object to how we process your data;</li>
        <li>request a copy of your data in a portable format;</li>
        <li>withdraw consent where we rely on it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, email
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a>. You also
        have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO)
        at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        PHV Prep UK is intended for adults preparing for a private hire licence.
        It is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect personal
        data from anyone under the age of 13. If you believe a child has provided
        us with personal data, please contact us and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your
        data, including encryption of data in transit, server-side verification of
        purchases, and access controls on our backend. No method of transmission
        or storage is completely secure, but we work to protect your data and
        keep our systems up to date.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise
        the "Last updated" date above. Significant changes will be communicated
        within the app where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this policy or your data, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
